@format 1
@id queue.create-convert-work
@title Create convert work
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Convert the tab request into work items, preserve relay routing, persist them, then repair unknown durations asynchronously.
@section I. UI
@tabs Convert
@flow TB
@related queue.add-work, processing.start, processing.source-output-collision

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LConvert
@alias convert = Cadroue.Application.LConvert
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier
@alias sidecar = Cadroue.Media.LSidecarStore

[input] Convert tab requests work <input>
- Receive priority, unlocked listed sources, output preset, source tab, and relay target @ ui.LConvertDescribe(...)
- Convert the preset and source relay batches into a work description @ ui.LConvertDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build conversion items <decision>
- Validate sources, recover known durations, and change each output name when it would exactly equal its source @ convert.LConvertItemsCreate(...)
? "No item is produced" > rejected
? "One or more items are produced" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Assign relay lineage, add every item to the shared schedule, and lock only sources whose records were accepted @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the queue result @ ui.LConvertDescribe(...)
> duration

[duration] Repair unknown durations <decision>
- Find newly persisted items whose end time is still unknown @ ui.LConvertDurationResolve(...)
? "Every duration was already known" > result
? "Unknown durations remain" > probe

[probe] Resolve and update duration <storage>
- Resolve unknown durations in bounded parallel work @ sidecar.LSidecarDurationResolve(...)
- Update each already-persisted schedule record @ schedule.LScheduleDurationSet(...)
> result

[result] Convert work queued <output>
= Persisted conversion items retain their tab and relay lineage; their sources are locked, and resolvable unknown durations are updated after insertion.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No conversion work record is added.
